low blood sugar and I used to have like,

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:12.870
protein snacks and protein bars and
apples with peanut butter. Well, I don't

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.780
recommend that any more, because every
time you snack,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:19.320
you're going to worsen the problem. You're
going to worsen the low blood sugar. You're

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:25.080
going to become a real hypoglycemic, which
is almost a pre-diabetes situation. So

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.519
continuing the snack always makes it
worse over time, okay? We're going to talk

00:00:29.519 --> 00:00:36.239
about why. So normal blood sugars: 100.
But it's usually between I'd say, 80

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:41.010
to 90, but you don't want it higher
than 100, okay? And what that means is one

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:46.829
teaspoon of sugar diluted to your all of
your blood in your body like, a gallon

00:00:46.829 --> 00:00:52.289
and a half of blood roughly, okay? So
that's not that much sugar. So what

00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:57.300
happens when you eat a snack, no matter
what you snack on, it doesn't matter but

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.289
protein will do this as well. You
actually elevate your sugars. You're

00:01:01.289 --> 00:01:06.510
bringing your sugar back up, okay? So the
sugar comes high and then that triggers

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:12.049
a hormone called insulin and the purpose
of insulin is to drive this sugar down.

00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:16.259
So you end up with a low blood sugar
situation. So here you are, eat a snack

00:01:16.259 --> 00:01:22.200
wait a couple hours, boom, it's down again.
You got to eat again. It's high, boom, down.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:26.159
It keeps coming up and down, up and down,
up and down and this is what's happening

00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:30.960
to a lot of people and it happens to me
as well. And it just worsens the problem

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:35.400
because they really don't understand the
background, what's behind the scene. They

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:39.090
don't realize that they're continuing
the problem. So you have to, number one,

00:01:39.090 --> 00:01:42.299
realize that snacking worsens the
problem, okay? Number two, we have to

00:01:42.299 --> 00:01:46.530
change what you eat at the meal. So you
really want to do this where you have

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:52.520
three meals a day starting out -- no snacks.
To do that, and to stabilize your sugar,

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:58.469
you need certain things. One of the most
important things to help insulin be

00:01:58.469 --> 00:02:03.990
stabilized and not go too high, or too
