00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:18.069
the most potassium. So but, here's the
thing, you need between about seven to

00:02:18.069 --> 00:02:23.769
10 cups of vegetable —  or even more salad,
if you're going to do salad, because

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:27.940
vegetables are a little bit more dense,
every single day to get this potassium

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:32.079
requirement. No one is doing that, so
they're going to have a hard time fixing

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:37.200
this blood sugar situation. So potassium, so you, if you, eat a meal the first

