thing you do is you have your, your vegetable,
your salad, okay? So if I'm gonna do that,

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.900
like I might do a kale shake, well, a huge salad. I'll eat that first before

00:02:45.099 --> 00:02:49.180
